Package: ubturbo-rmrs
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: UB Turbo resource management framework
 This package contains the ubturbo daemon (ub_turbo_exec),
 client library (libubturbo_client.so), RMRS plugin,
 configuration files, and systemd service.

Package: ubturbo-devel
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development headers for UB Turbo framework
 This package contains C headers for integrating with the
 UB Turbo SDK (turbo_conf.h, turbo_def.h, turbo_ipc_*.h, etc.).
